keywords:
  - genomic imprinting
  - DNA methylation
  - Illumina methylation arrays
  - imprinting control regions
  - R
abstract: >-
  imprintomeR provides quantitative analysis and visualization of genomic
  imprinting from Illumina 450K, EPIC and EPICv2 methylation arrays: QC
  preprocessing, sample-level imprinting deviation scores (IDS and Angle),
  per-ICR calls with a multi-locus summary, reference centring on control
  samples, and plots including polar, radar and per-ICR heatmaps.
